# sys-waterfall: Route 210 North, the waterfall at (505, 525). Surf
# from (504, 532), north under the bridge, Waterfall up (FIELD_MOVES 13) and back down. The
# `waterfall-*` screenshot lines are the browser spec's key beat (the player drawn at the top, the
# view moved up the falls).
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_FEN
give badge platinum:BADGE_ID_BEACON
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 50 platinum:MOVE_SURF platinum:MOVE_WATERFALL
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_210_NORTH 504 532 right
until idle
+0 field move 0 platinum:MOVE_SURF
advance text
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_210_NORTH 505 532
+0 press up
until position 505 526
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert facing player up
+0 screenshot waterfall-bottom
+0 field move 0 platinum:MOVE_WATERFALL
advance text
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_210_NORTH 505 524
+0 assert state playerState "surf"
+0 screenshot waterfall-top
+0 press down
+1 release down
until idle
+0 assert facing player down
+0 field move 0 platinum:MOVE_WATERFALL
advance text
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_210_NORTH 505 526
+0 assert state playerState "surf"
